{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">PHYSICS-BASED PLATFORMING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/044427c47d0cb08bf573b09379eba1a7.poster.avif?t=1760381126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/044427c47d0cb08bf573b09379eba1a7.webm?t=1760381126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/044427c47d0cb08bf573b09379eba1a7.mp4?t=1760381126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Willow's Descent</i> combines time-tested platforming mechanics in creative ways to deliver a steadily rising sense of challenge and intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/9c91c406dceebf3f4b34ad66eb375005.poster.avif?t=1760381126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/9c91c406dceebf3f4b34ad66eb375005.webm?t=1760381126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/9c91c406dceebf3f4b34ad66eb375005.mp4?t=1760381126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level and physics interaction is carefully designed to keep players in a satisfying flow state. Hidden shortcuts and an on-screen timer subtly invite speedrunners to test their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE WHIMSICAL WORLD OF THE ARRETAI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/375cfa5266e97b0eb1fb56f5d6a040de.avif?t=1760381126\" width=562 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring three unique, hand-crafted biomes, <strong>WILLOW\u2019S DESCENT: INTO THE UNDER</strong> invites players to explore the enchanting world inhabited by Willow and her fellow Arretai. Leap across deadly spikes and mushroomflowers in the forest outside Willow's village, dash through desert sands and ancient ruins, and tread carefully through deep caves as you draw ever closer to finding Pico.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/b056cbb82bd88138d22b9559c8243b58.avif?t=1760381126\" width=265 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3352160?t=1760381126","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760381126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/3e216368a608a9f304e519abf04ea57518bde292/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760381126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/3e216368a608a9f304e519abf04ea57518bde292/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760381126","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3421730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">PHYSICS-BASED PLATFORMING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/044427c47d0cb08bf573b09379eba1a7.poster.avif?t=1760381126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/044427c47d0cb08bf573b09379eba1a7.webm?t=1760381126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/044427c47d0cb08bf573b09379eba1a7.mp4?t=1760381126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Willow's Descent</i> combines time-tested platforming mechanics in creative ways to deliver a steadily rising sense of challenge and intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/9c91c406dceebf3f4b34ad66eb375005.poster.avif?t=1760381126\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/9c91c406dceebf3f4b34ad66eb375005.webm?t=1760381126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/9c91c406dceebf3f4b34ad66eb375005.mp4?t=1760381126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level and physics interaction is carefully designed to keep players in a satisfying flow state. Hidden shortcuts and an on-screen timer subtly invite speedrunners to test their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE WHIMSICAL WORLD OF THE ARRETAI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/375cfa5266e97b0eb1fb56f5d6a040de.avif?t=1760381126\" width=562 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring three unique, hand-crafted biomes, <strong>WILLOW\u2019S DESCENT: INTO THE UNDER</strong> invites players to explore the enchanting world inhabited by Willow and her fellow Arretai. Leap across deadly spikes and mushroomflowers in the forest outside Willow's village, dash through desert sands and ancient ruins, and tread carefully through deep caves as you draw ever closer to finding Pico.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/extras/b056cbb82bd88138d22b9559c8243b58.avif?t=1760381126\" width=265 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LunaMothic"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352160/header.jpg?t=1760381126","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3352160/707971810/7fb692a373d97135004e8fbac59af3f638d08a8c/1760379519/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760381124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3352160/707971810/7fb692a373d97135004e8fbac59af3f638d08a8c/1760379519/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760381124","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3352160/707971810/7fb692a373d97135004e8fbac59af3f638d08a8c/1760379519/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760381124","id":257217324,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217324/movie480.mp4?t=1760381124","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217324/movie_max.mp4?t=1760381124"},"name":"Willow's Descent Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257217324/802290ea1c66dd60dc26040adf5f4e570b20b4